  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Net-Zero, Nature-Positive Dairy: Climate-Smart Dairy Value Chains through Energy Transition &amp; Nature-Based Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sri Lanka&#x2019;s dairy sector is at a critical juncture, facing cascading climate shocks, economic hardship, and deepening rural inequality&#x2014;challenges that disproportionately affect women, youth, and marginalized estate communities. Rural poverty has more than doubled since 2019, and women&#x2014;who make up a significant share of the agricultural workforce&#x2014;are especially vulnerable due to limited access to resources, technology, and decision-making platforms. In climate-vulnerable districts like Kilinochch</narrative>
  </description>
